{"title": "Submersible", "pageid": 39655, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Submersible", "categories": ["Locations", "Act Three Locations"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Max-bolotin-maxim-bolotin-submarine-3.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Max-bolotin-maxim-bolotin-submarine-3.jpg/300px-Max-bolotin-maxim-bolotin-submarine-3.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Max-bolotin-maxim-bolotin-submarine-3.jpg/450px-Max-bolotin-maxim-bolotin-submarine-3.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Max-bolotin-maxim-bolotin-submarine-3.jpg/600px-Max-bolotin-maxim-bolotin-submarine-3.jpg.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Max-bolotin-maxim-bolotin-submarine-3.jpg/300px-Max-bolotin-maxim-bolotin-submarine-3.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cc/Max-bolotin-maxim-bolotin-submarine-3.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption><div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">  Concept art by Maxim Bolotin  </div></figcaption></figure>The <b>Submersible</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Location\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Location\">Location</a> within the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>. It can be accessed from the basement of <a href=\"/wiki/Flymm_Cargo\" title=\"Flymm Cargo\">Flymm Cargo</a>, and provides access to the <a href=\"/wiki/Iron_Throne\" title=\"Iron Throne\">Iron Throne</a>. \n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Information\">Information</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Max-bolotin-maxim-bolotin-submarine-4.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Max-bolotin-maxim-bolotin-submarine-4.jpg/300px-Max-bolotin-maxim-bolotin-submarine-4.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Max-bolotin-maxim-bolotin-submarine-4.jpg/450px-Max-bolotin-maxim-bolotin-submarine-4.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Max-bolotin-maxim-bolotin-submarine-4.jpg/600px-Max-bolotin-maxim-bolotin-submarine-4.jpg.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Max-bolotin-maxim-bolotin-submarine-4.jpg/300px-Max-bolotin-maxim-bolotin-submarine-4.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Max-bolotin-maxim-bolotin-submarine-4.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>The interior of the Submersible</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The Submersible is the only way to access the Iron Throne. Taking control of it awards the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Guild_Artisan#Lantanna_Marvel\" title=\"Guild Artisan\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/38px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/50px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lantanna Marvel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Guild_Artisan#Lantanna_Marvel\" title=\"Guild Artisan\">Lantanna Marvel</a> inspiration to party members with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Guild_Artisan\" title=\"Guild Artisan\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png/20px-Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png/30px-Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png/40px-Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Guild Artisan\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png/20px-Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Background_Guild_Artisan_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Guild_Artisan\" title=\"Guild Artisan\">Guild Artisan</a> background.\n</p><p>Upon docking at the Iron Throne, the party start in this \"safe location\": the timer for the Iron Throne does not begin until a party member descends through the hatch to the Iron Throne itself. \n</p><p>Gondians who are rescued from the prison flee to here and gather in the seats along the edges.\n</p><p>Following the events of the Iron Throne quest, the party can speak with any survivors onboard before returning through the hatch to the basement of Flymm's Cargo. \n</p><p>Once the party disembark from the Submersible after returning from the Iron Throne, they cannot return to either.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_quests\">Related quests</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rescue_the_Grand_Duke\" title=\"Rescue the Grand Duke\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rescue the Grand Duke\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Rescue_the_Grand_Duke\" title=\"Rescue the Grand Duke\">Rescue the Grand Duke</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Retrieve_Omeluum\" title=\"Retrieve Omeluum\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Retrieve Omeluum\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Retrieve_Omeluum\" title=\"Retrieve Omeluum\">Retrieve Omeluum</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Save_the_Gondians\" title=\"Save the Gondians\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Save the Gondians\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wi